  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: da967a0ca1faba14ea2f13ad6e50edd2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Michael
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Michael
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 93f0ca6afc79dda4095724da1367ac75, type: 3}
  age: 22
  gender: 0
  birthdate: 
  appearance: Short, unkempt brown hair, welding goggles hanging from his neck, a
    stubble beard. He wears mountain clothing, but modified with technological items
    such as vests with energy pockets and gloves with sensors. He often has traces
    of grease or dust on his hands and face.
  personalityTraits: 140000000b000000
  motivations: Rediscover the human value of technology, beyond consumption.
  background: 'Michael was a very promising engineer in the outside world. He worked
    on several projects of smart cities and robotics for care, but he ended up disillusioned
    when he saw how his inventions were used to control and exploit, rather than
    to help.



    One day he decided to disconnect... but not completely. He took
    his technology into the woods to try to reinvent its use, to create a new relationship
    with machines. Thus was born his cabin: a self-sustaining shelter powered by
    solar energy, full of hybrid systems of nature and science.'
  speechStyle: 1
  otherInfo: "Michael has never spoken to Laia, but he knows the routes she walks,
    has observed what she photographs and has even read some text she forgot on a
    crumpled sheet. The camera he is building for her is a mix of cutting-edge technology
    and artisanal magic, designed to capture not only images, but also \u201Cthe
    feeling of the moment\u201D."
